      "title": "垂直分量決定磁力",
      "subtitle": "磁場改為向右；正電荷速度在紙面逆時針旋轉。0 到 180 度間力入紙，兩端為零；箭頭方向示意。",
      "look": "請看全課圖二，也就是本堂第二張圖。先讀圖上「磁場改沿正橫軸」的提醒，再依次試零度、三十度、九十度與一百八十度。看數值的同時，追著垂直分量箭頭看。這裡停下來，等你能說明兩個端點為什麼都是零，再繼續。",
      "diagram": "<svg id=\"emmagnet-angle-svg\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 600\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"emmagnet-angle-title emmagnet-angle-desc\"><title id=\"emmagnet-angle-title\">垂直分量決定磁力</title><desc id=\"emmagnet-angle-desc\">磁場改為向右；正電荷速度在紙面逆時針旋轉。0 到 180 度間力入紙，兩端為零；箭頭方向示意。</desc><defs><marker id=\"emmagnet-angle-mint-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10Z\" fill=\"#78e2ca\"/></marker><marker id=\"emmagnet-angle-amber-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10Z\" fill=\"#ffc67b\"/></marker><marker id=\"emmagnet-angle-blue-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10Z\" fill=\"#8db8ff\"/></marker><marker id=\"emmagnet-angle-pink-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10Z\" fill=\"#ef9dbb\"/></marker><marker id=\"emmagnet-angle-axis-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"5\" markerHeight=\"5\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10Z\" fill=\"#71889b\"/></marker></defs><style>text{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;fill:#eef3f6;font-size:24px}.dash{stroke-dasharray:7 6}.muted-text{fill:#a8b7c6}.big-text{font-size:28px;font-weight:650}.mint{stroke:#78e2ca;fill:none;stroke-width:3}.mint-fill{fill:#78e2ca}.amber{stroke:#ffc67b;fill:none;stroke-width:3}.amber-fill{fill:#ffc67b}.blue{stroke:#8db8ff;fill:none;stroke-width:3}.blue-fill{fill:#8db8ff}.pink{stroke:#ef9dbb;fill:none;stroke-width:3}.pink-fill{fill:#ef9dbb}.axis{stroke:#71889b;fill:none;stroke-width:3}.axis-fill{fill:#71889b}</style><rect width=\"600\" height=\"600\" fill=\"#111f30\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"40\" class=\"\" text-anchor=\"start\">本圖改設：B 沿 +x，v 在 xy 面</text><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"520\" y2=\"300\" class=\"axis\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"350\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"80\" class=\"axis\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"300\" class=\"blue\" marker-end=\"url(#emmagnet-angle-blue-arrow)\"/><text x=\"450\" y=\"340\" class=\"blue-fill\" text-anchor=\"start\">B +x</text><line id=\"emmagnet-v-par\" x1=\"300\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"300\" class=\"amber dash\"/><line id=\"emmagnet-v-perp\" x1=\"300\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"140\" class=\"pink dash\"/><line id=\"emmagnet-v-arrow\" x1=\"300\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"140\" class=\"mint\" marker-end=\"url(#emmagnet-angle-mint-arrow)\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"410\" class=\"\" text-anchor=\"start\">綠：速度；橘：平行分量</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"455\" class=\"\" text-anchor=\"start\">粉：垂直分量（才產生磁力）</text><text id=\"emmagnet-angle-reading\" x=\"30\" y=\"510\">θ = 90°；|F| = .200 μN</text><text id=\"emmagnet-angle-direction\" x=\"30\" y=\"555\">F 沿 −z，入紙</text></svg>",
      "takeaways": "<div class=\"takeaway\"><span>大小</span><strong>|F| = .20 sin θ μN</strong></div><div class=\"takeaway\"><span>方向</span><strong>Fz = −.20 sin θ μN</strong></div>",
      "detail": "<p class=\"equation\">v∥ = v cos θ；v⊥ = v sin θ</p><p>速度固定 1000 m/s，B 固定 .20 T，q 固定 +1 nC。0°、30°、90°、180° 的力為 0、.10、.20、0 μN。</p><p>來源：本地《電磁學（中）》第 8 章；圖解電磁學第 11／12 章。</p><p>自我檢核：30° 與 150°：垂直分量相同，力同向且同大小。</p>",
